chapters.tangkhul_text:
Samvidhan Preamble:
ITHUM INDIAWUI MIKUMO, India-li Sovereign, Socialist, Secular, Democratic Republic akha sakhavai solemn ningkacham eina kasakakhui, kala chiwui citizen pupupwui vang:
JUSTICE (Mashung-kasa): Social, economic, kala political;
LIBERTY (Khangachon / Mathat): Ningkhamathan, phasha-kashak, chotkhangashit, kala worship;
EQUALITY (Khangayam): Thot-phā kala opportunity wui ngachaili;
FRATERNITY (Uningnao ngayeikasa): Mikumo akha-akhawui dignity kala Nationwui unity kala integrity ngashankhavai;
ITHUI CONSTITUENT ASSEMBLY-li November 26, 1949 zingsho eina Samvidhan hi adopt salaga, enact salaga ithuwui aphasa thapupli miserie.

